{"text":"purananuru","n":313,"lines":["அத்தம் நண்ணிய நாடுகெழு பெருவிறல்","கைப்பொருள் யாதொன்றும் இலனே நச்சிக்","காணிய சென்ற இரவன் மாக்கள்","களிறொடு நெடுந்தேர் வேண்டினும் கடவ","உப்பொய் சாகாட்டு உமணர் காட்ட","கழிமுரி குன்றத்து அற்றே","எள் அமைவு இன்று அவன் உள்ளிய பொருளே"],"tr":["attam naṇṇiya nāṭukeḻu peruviṟal","kaipporuḷ yātoṉṟum ilaṉē naccik","kāṇiya ceṉṟa iravaṉ mākkaḷ","kaḷiṟoṭu neṭuntēr vēṇṭiṉum kaṭava","uppoy cākāṭṭu umaṇar kāṭṭa","kaḻimuri kuṉṟattu aṟṟē","eḷ amaivu iṉṟu avaṉ uḷḷiya poruḷē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"vākai","tinai_ta":"வாகை","turai_ta":"வல்லான் முல்லை","poet_ta":"மாங்குடி மருதனார்","poet_tr":"Māṅkuṭi Marutaṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"7 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"6×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 26, veṇcīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 13, veṇṭaḷai 12, kalittaḷai 1"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"அத்தம்","tr":"attam","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"அத்","tr":"at"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தம்","tr":"tam"}]},{"text":"நண்ணிய","tr":"naṇṇiya","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நண்","tr":"naṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ணிய","tr":"ṇiya"}]},{"text":"நாடுகெழு","tr":"nāṭukeḻu","foot":"kūviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நா","tr":"nā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டுகெ","tr":"ṭuke"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ழு","tr":"ḻu"}]},{"text":"பெருவிறல்","tr":"peruviṟal","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெரு","tr":"peru"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"விறல்","tr":"viṟal"}]}],[{"text":"கைப்பொருள்","tr":"kaipporuḷ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கைப்","tr":"kaip"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"பொருள்","tr":"poruḷ"}]},{"text":"யாதொன்","tr":"yātoṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தொன்","tr":"toṉ"}]},{"text":"றுமிலனே","tr":"ṟumilaṉē","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"றுமி","tr":"ṟumi"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"லனே","tr":"laṉē"}]},{"text":"நச்சிக்","tr":"naccik","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நச்","tr":"nac"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"சிக்","tr":"cik"}]}],[{"text":"காணிய","tr":"kāṇiya","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ணிய","tr":"ṇiya"}]},{"text":"சென்ற","tr":"ceṉṟa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"சென்","tr":"ceṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ற","tr":"ṟa"}]},{"text":"விரவன்","tr":"viravaṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"விர","tr":"vira"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வன்","tr":"vaṉ"}]},{"text":"மாக்கள்","tr":"mākkaḷ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மாக்","tr":"māk"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கள்","tr":"kaḷ"}]}],[{"text":"களிறொடு","tr":"kaḷiṟoṭu","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"களி","tr":"kaḷi"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றொடு","tr":"ṟoṭu"}]},{"text":"நெடுந்தேர்","tr":"neṭuntēr","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நெடுந்","tr":"neṭun"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தேர்","tr":"tēr"}]},{"text":"வேண்டினும்","tr":"vēṇṭiṉum","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வேண்","tr":"vēṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டினும்","tr":"ṭiṉum"}]},{"text":"கடவ","tr":"kaṭava","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கட","tr":"kaṭa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வ","tr":"va"}]}],[{"text":"வுப்பொய்","tr":"vuppoy","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வுப்","tr":"vup"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பொய்","tr":"poy"}]},{"text":"சாகாட்","tr":"cākāṭ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"சா","tr":"cā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"காட்","tr":"kāṭ"}]},{"text":"டுமணர்","tr":"ṭumaṇar","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"டும","tr":"ṭuma"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ணர்","tr":"ṇar"}]},{"text":"காட்ட","tr":"kāṭṭa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"காட்","tr":"kāṭ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ட","tr":"ṭa"}]}],[{"text":"கழிமுரி","tr":"kaḻimuri","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கழி","tr":"kaḻi"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"முரி","tr":"muri"}]},{"text":"குன்றத்","tr":"kuṉṟat","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"குன்","tr":"kuṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றத்","tr":"ṟat"}]},{"text":"தற்றே","tr":"taṟṟē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தற்","tr":"taṟ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றே","tr":"ṟē"}]}],[{"text":"யெள்ளமை","tr":"yeḷḷamai","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யெள்","tr":"yeḷ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ளமை","tr":"ḷamai"}]},{"text":"வுவின்றவ","tr":"vuviṉṟava","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"வுவின்","tr":"vuviṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றவ","tr":"ṟava"}]},{"text":"னுள்ளிய","tr":"ṉuḷḷiya","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"னுள்","tr":"ṉuḷ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ளிய","tr":"ḷiya"}]},{"text":"பொருளே","tr":"poruḷē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பொரு","tr":"poru"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளே","tr":"ḷē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"அத்தம்","parts":[{"text":"அத்தம்","lemma":"attam","gloss":"wilderness"}],"gloss":"wilderness"},{"surface":"நண்ணிய","parts":[{"text":"நண்ணிய","lemma":"naṇṇu","gloss":"approached"}],"gloss":"approached"},{"surface":"நாடு","parts":[{"text":"நாடு","lemma":"nāṭu","gloss":"country"}],"gloss":"country"},{"surface":"கெழு","parts":[{"text":"கெழு","lemma":"keḻu","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"having"},{"surface":"பெருவிறல்","parts":[{"text":"பெரு","lemma":"peru","gloss":"great"},{"text":"விறல்","lemma":"viṟal","gloss":"strength"}],"gloss":"great strength"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கைப்பொருள்","parts":[{"text":"கை","lemma":"kai","gloss":"hand"},{"text":"பொருள்","lemma":"poruḷ","gloss":"wealth"}],"gloss":"wealth in hand"},{"surface":"யாதொன்றும்","parts":[{"text":"யாது","lemma":"yātu","gloss":"what"},{"text":"ஒன்றும்","lemma":"oṉṟum","gloss":"even one"}],"gloss":"anything at all"},{"surface":"இலனே","parts":[{"text":"இலன்","lemma":"ilaṉ","gloss":"he has not"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"he has not indeed"},{"surface":"நச்சி","parts":[{"text":"நச்சி","lemma":"naccu","gloss":"desiring"}],"gloss":"desiring"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"காணிய","parts":[{"text":"காணிய","lemma":"kāṇ","gloss":"to see"}],"gloss":"to see"},{"surface":"சென்ற","parts":[{"text":"சென்ற","lemma":"cel","gloss":"who went"}],"gloss":"who went"},{"surface":"இரவன்","parts":[{"text":"இரவு","lemma":"iravu","gloss":"begging"},{"text":"அன்","lemma":"aṉ","gloss":"masculine suffix"}],"gloss":"begging"},{"surface":"மாக்கள்","parts":[{"text":"மாக்கள்","lemma":"mākkaḷ","gloss":"people"}],"gloss":"people"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"களிறொடு","parts":[{"text":"களிறு","lemma":"kaḷiṟu","gloss":"male elephant"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"oṭu","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with male elephant"},{"surface":"நெடுந்தேர்","parts":[{"text":"நெடுந்தேர்","lemma":"நெடுந்தேர்","gloss":"tall chariot"}],"gloss":"tall chariot","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வேண்டினும்","parts":[{"text":"வேண்டின்","lemma":"vēṇṭu","gloss":"if requested"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"even if requested"},{"surface":"கடவ","parts":[{"text":"கடவ","lemma":"kaṭavu","gloss":"duty-bound"}],"gloss":"are duty-bound to be given"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"உப்பொய்","parts":[{"text":"உப்பொய்","lemma":"உப்பொய்","gloss":"salt-carrying"}],"gloss":"salt-carrying","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"சாகாட்டு","parts":[{"text":"சாகாட்டு","lemma":"சாகாட்டு","gloss":"of the cart"}],"gloss":"of the cart","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"உமணர்","parts":[{"text":"உமணர்","lemma":"umaṇar","gloss":"salt-merchants"}],"gloss":"salt-merchants"},{"surface":"காட்ட","parts":[{"text":"காட்ட","lemma":"kāṭṭu","gloss":"when pointed out"}],"gloss":"when pointed out"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கழிமுரி","parts":[{"text":"கழி","lemma":"kaḻi","gloss":"backwater"},{"text":"முரி","lemma":"muri","gloss":"eroded"}],"gloss":"eroded by backwaters"},{"surface":"குன்றத்து","parts":[{"text":"குன்று","lemma":"kuṉṟu","gloss":"hill"},{"text":"அத்து","lemma":"attu","gloss":"inflectional increment"}],"gloss":"of the hill"},{"surface":"அற்றே","parts":[{"text":"அற்று","lemma":"aṟṟu","gloss":"like that"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"is of that nature indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"எள்","parts":[{"text":"எள்","lemma":"eḷ","gloss":"scorn"}],"gloss":"scorn"},{"surface":"அமைவு","parts":[{"text":"அமைவு","lemma":"amaivu","gloss":"occurrence"}],"gloss":"occurrence"},{"surface":"இன்று","parts":[{"text":"இன்று","lemma":"iṉṟu","gloss":"without"}],"gloss":"without"},{"surface":"அவன்","parts":[{"text":"அவன்","lemma":"avaṉ","gloss":"he"}],"gloss":"he"},{"surface":"உள்ளிய","parts":[{"text":"உள்ளிய","lemma":"uḷḷu","gloss":"thought of"}],"gloss":"thought of"},{"surface":"பொருளே","parts":[{"text":"பொருள்","lemma":"poruḷ","gloss":"wealth"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"wealth indeed"}]}],"literal":"The great strong one of the land bordering the wilderness / has absolutely no wealth in hand; yet, desiring / the begging people who went to see him, / even if they ask for male elephants along with tall chariots, those are to be given / like when salt-merchants of salt-carrying carts point out / the hillock eroded by backwaters, / without any room for scorn is the wealth he thinks of giving.","translation":"The lord of great strength, whose land borders the wilderness, has absolutely no wealth left in his hands. Yet, when supplicants go to him in hope, even if they ask for male elephants and tall chariots, he is duty-bound to give them. His giving is like a hillock eroded by backwaters, pointed out by salt-merchants driving salt-laden carts to dig up for earth; he lets himself be entirely depleted. The wealth he intends to give leaves no room for scorn.","modern":"காட்டு வழியை ஒட்டிய நாட்டின் தலைவனான பெரும் வலிமை கொண்ட அவனிடம் கையில் பொருள் ஏதும் இல்லை. ஆயினும், அவனை நாடிச் சென்ற இரவலர்கள் யானைகளையும் பெரிய தேர்களையும் கேட்டாலும், அவற்றை அவர்களுக்குக் கொடுப்பது அவனது கடமையாகும். உப்பு ஏற்றிச் செல்லும் வண்டிகளை உடைய உமணர், சேற்று வழியை அடைப்பதற்காக உப்பங்கழியால் அரிக்கப்பட்ட குன்றைக் காட்டி அதிலிருந்து மண்ணை வெட்டி எடுப்பது போல, அவன் தன்னை முழுமையாக அழித்துக் கொடையளிப்பான். அவன் கொடுக்க நினைக்கும் கொடைப்பொருள் எள்ளளவும் இகழ்ச்சிக்கு இடமில்லாதது.","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Vākai tiṇai and Vallāṉ Mullai tuṟai, which extols the generous nature and valour of a warrior even in times of poverty. The poet Māṅkuṭi Marutaṉār praises a local chieftain who rules a dry, wilderness-bordering territory. Though the chieftain has no personal wealth left in his hands, he feels absolutely duty-bound to satisfy the grand requests of visiting supplicants, even if they ask for elephants and chariots. The poet uses a vivid dry-land image: salt-merchants driving heavy carts point to a coastal hillock eroded by backwaters to dig up its earth to pave their muddy path, eventually leveling the hillock. Similarly, the chieftain allows his own resources to be completely depleted by those in need, ensuring his reputation for unstinting generosity remains free from any scorn.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.7],[0.7,1.2],[1.2,1.5],[1.5,2.9],[2.9,3.5],[3.5,3.9],[3.9,4.4],[4.4,5.0],[5.0,5.2],[5.2,5.4],[5.4,5.7],[5.7,6.9],[6.9,7.1],[7.1,7.7],[7.7,8.3],[8.3,8.94],[9.1,9.6],[9.6,9.7],[9.7,10.2],[10.2,11.4],[11.4,12.42],[12.42,12.67],[12.67,12.8],[12.8,13.3],[13.3,13.6],[13.6,13.8],[13.8,14.1],[14.1,14.5]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.8],[0.8,1.3],[1.3,1.7],[1.7,3.3],[3.3,4.0],[4.0,4.3],[4.3,4.3],[4.3,5.6],[5.6,5.8],[5.8,6.0],[6.0,6.4],[6.4,6.4],[6.4,8.6],[8.6,8.7],[8.7,9.5],[9.5,10.14],[10.3,10.8],[10.8,11.0],[11.0,11.6],[11.6,12.8],[12.8,13.4],[13.4,13.5],[13.5,13.5],[13.5,15.0],[15.0,15.3],[15.3,15.5],[15.5,15.8],[15.8,16.3]]},"sync":[[["அத்தம்","wilderness"]],[["நண்ணிய","approached"]],[["நாடு","country"],["கெழு","having"]],[["பெருவிறல்","great strength"]],[["கைப்பொருள்","wealth in hand"]],[["யாதொன்றும்","anything at all"]],[["இலனே","he has not indeed"]],[["நச்சி","desiring"]],[["காணிய","to see"]],[["சென்ற","who went"]],[["இரவன்","begging"]],[["மாக்கள்","people"]],[["க